e", "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Re-runs robust tuning, SHAP pruning and evaluation across increasing numbers of robust seeds (e.g. 1/3/5/10/15) to find where results plateau, so the main pipeline can justify its seed count; a new sweep_<id> folder is created whenever the subset manifest or effective config diverges so stale results are never silently reused. chosen_seeds_latest.rds lets the main driver optionally reuse the selected seeds (use_robust_seeds_from_tuning_sweep = TRUE)."}, {"id": "modelling_analysis__readme_species_mean_baseline", "label": "Species-mean Baseline Comparison", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 30", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each fitted model is benchmarked against a naive species-mean predictor under the same CV so fold-wise and pooled performance deltas show actual skill beyond species identity."}, {"id": "modelling_analysis__readme_r2_decomposition", "label": "Fold-level R2 Decomposition (SS_res / SS_tot)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 54", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Negative or unstable fold-level R2 is frequently caused by low within-fold target variance (small SS_tot) rather than poor predictions; decomposing R2 into its components makes that failure mode visible and justifies reporting pooled metrics."}, {"id": "modelling_analysis__readme_fold_design_sensitivity", "label": "Fold Design Sensitivity (n_folds and fold seed)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Holds tuned covariates and hyperparameters fixed while varying fold count and fold seeds so that the effect of fold composition and train size on R2/RMSE can be isolated cheaply without re-tuning, justifying the chosen fold design."}], "edges": [{"source": "modelling_analysis__readme", "target": "modelling_analysis_run_tuning_seed_sweep", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 10", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "modelling_analysis__readme", "target": "modelling_analysis_sensitivity_suite", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 18", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "modelling_analysis__readme", "target": "modelling_analysis_model_comparison", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 26", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "modelling_analysis__readme", "target": "modelling_analysis_fold_sensitivity_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 34", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "modelling_analysis__readme", "target": "modelling_analysis_compile_model_performance_summaries", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 42", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "modelling_analysis__readme", "target": "modelling_analysis_diagnose_r2_components_by_fold", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "modelling/analysis/_README.md", "source_location": "line 50", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "modelling_analysis_run_tuning_seed_sweep", "target": "modelling_pipeline_config", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidenc